сь абс­цисс. По­это­му ис­ко­мая точка <span data-inline-latex=\"x=-3\"></span>.</p>", "title": "Решение", "asset_keys": []}, "operation": "rewrite", "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T16:10:12.900738+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_1"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T16:10:12.900738+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_2"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T16:10:12.900738+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_3"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T16:10:12.900738+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_4"}]}, "normalized_content": {"assets": [{"alt": "", "url": "/assets/66a89e38-39f9-4026-abfb-62e2b9af6eb9", "kind": "ordinary_image", "asset_id": "66a89e38-39f9-4026-abfb-62e2b9af6eb9", "asset_key": "image_1", "transformation_target_id": "asset:image_1"}], "format": "teacherhelper-normalized", "sections": [{"key": "condition", "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"66a89e38-39f9-4026-abfb-62e2b9af6eb9\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\" src=\"/assets/66a89e38-39f9-4026-abfb-62e2b9af6eb9\"/> На ри­сун­ке изоб­ра­жен гра­фик про­из­вод­ной функ­ции  <span data-inline-latex=\"f(x)\"></span> . Най­ди­те абс­цис­су точки, в ко­то­рой ка­са­тель­ная к гра­фи­ку <span data-inline-latex=\"y=f(x)\"></span>   па­рал­лель­на оси абс­цисс или сов­па­да­ет с ней.</p>", "title": "Условие", "asset_keys": ["image_1"], "section_id": "condition:1", "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"}, {"key": "answer", "html": "<p><span data-effect=\"spaced\">-3</span></p>", "title": "Ответ", "asset_keys": [], "section_id": "answer:1", "transformation_target_id": "section:ans